<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Verify your LinguaLearn account</title>
<style>
  body  { margin:0; padding:0; background:#f7f9fc; font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; }
  .outer{ padding:40px 16px; }
  .card { max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; background:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid #e2e8f2; }
  .hdr  { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2563eb,#3b82f6); padding:36px 40px 28px; text-align:center; }
  .logo { font-size:24px; font-weight:700; color:#fff; letter-spacing:-.5px; }
  .logo span { opacity:.7; }
  .hdr-sub{ color:rgba(255,255,255,.75); font-size:13px; margin-top:5px; }
  .body { padding:40px; }
  .badge{ display:inline-block; background:#eff6ff; color:#2563eb; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; padding:4px 14px; border-radius:100px; border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,.2); margin-bottom:18px; }
  h1   { font-size:22px; font-weight:600; color:#0d1526; margin:0 0 14px; }
  p    { font-size:15px; color:#4a5568; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 18px; }
  .btn-wrap{ text-align:center; margin:30px 0; }
  .btn { display:inline-block; background:#2563eb; color:#ffffff !important; text-decoration:none; padding:15px 40px; border-radius:100px; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; }
  hr   { border:none; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f2; margin:28px 0; }
  .small{ font-size:13px; color:#7a87a0; line-height:1.6; }
  .url  { word-break:break-all; color:#2563eb; font-size:13px; }
  .ftr  { background:#f7f9fc; padding:22px 40px; text-align:center; border-top:1px solid #e2e8f2; }
  .ftr p{ font-size:12px; color:#a0aec0; margin:0; line-height:1.6; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="outer">
<div class="card">

  <div class="hdr">
    <div class="logo">Lingua<span>Learn</span></div>
    <div class="hdr-sub">Language learning platform</div>
  </div>

  <div class="body">
    <div class="badge">✉ Email Verification</div>
    <h1>Hello, {{ user.firstName }}!</h1>
    <p>Thanks for creating your LinguaLearn account. One quick step before you start learning — please verify your email address.</p>
    <p>This link expires in <strong>24 hours</strong>.</p>

    <div class="btn-wrap">
      <a href="{{ verifyUrl }}" class="btn">✓ Verify my email</a>
    </div>

    <hr>
    <p class="small">Button not working? Paste this link into your browser:</p>
    <p class="url">{{ verifyUrl }}</p>
    <hr>
    <p class="small">If you didn't create a LinguaLearn account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="ftr">
    <p>© {{ "now"|date("Y") }} LinguaLearn &nbsp;·&nbsp; Automated message — please do not reply.</p>
  </div>

</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
